      "message": "What is the relation between `aptx_voice` flag and the aptx_swb_power_management sysprop ?\n\nI am asking since a flag is intended to be removed in a few months when we think the feature is stable enough, while the sysprop should stay forever and because of that need to have proper justification.\n\nAlso can you create a bug in this component: 1387432 to track the flag lifecycle and add the bug to this CL and all other CL related to this flag",
